 describing v5.1.0 as the cause and the rollback as the fix. There were no other open incidents, so it isn't a duplicate.\n\nSomeone still needs to find out what's wrong in v5.1.0 before it's deployed again.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_0156ALYmPH2WEF94ZZSu2sK5", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01DnmwHxX1NvTyLL5TXD2zn5", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01DqKBFJys2JfUJPErpGLL8V", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_015KQrvbSd6GPpre3mkRKv5R", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01MU4jdQ2vB8BQh35a6ryxud", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-service"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01AWL7uTPKUsnnHX9drQHWdK", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payment-service"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_019FjAp173VqSD4twmBpB9XP", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01MJC2YT263HHYFDEHhoXaux", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api", "version": "v5.0.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Jw1NMpBtK5cwXhgMsCuXET", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "payments-api elevated errors after v5.1.0 deploy", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "payments-api", "summary": "payments-api v5.1.0 (deployed this morning to us-east, us-west, eu-west) has been unhealthy with an error rate of about 18%. It is being rolled back to v5.0.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production.", "idempotency_key": "payments-api-v5.1.0-rollback-sev2"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01BezEa8jsG4AxAP9PP2gb6Y", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I rolled payments back to its last healthy release and opened a SEV2 incident, which paged the on-call engineer. The service is healthy again.\n\n- **Which service:** No service is registered as \"payments.\" The affected one is `payments-api`. This morning's release, v5.1.0, was marked degraded and had about an 18% error rate in us-east, us-west and eu-west.\n- **Rollback:** I rolled `payments-api` back to v5.0.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. It's now live in all three regions. A follow-up check shows it as healthy, with the error rate down to about 0.2%. v5.0.0 has run healthy in production before, so this didn't need change-manager approval.\n- **Incident:** I opened INC-0001 (SEV2) for `payments-api`, describing v5.1.0 as the cause and the rollback as the fix. There were no other open incidents, so it isn't a duplicate.\n\nSomeone still needs to find out what's wrong in v5.1.0 before it's deployed again.", "type": "text"}]}]}